      <div class="small-12 medium-5 columns home">
        <article id="search">
          <div id="homeSearch">
            <input type="text" id="searchTerms" placeholder="Search by Employee, Agency, or Vendor" class="search" autocomplete="off" />
          </div>
        </article>
        <p>Arkansas financial transparency data can be accessed in two ways:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Use the search to locate information for a specific employee, vendor or agency</li>
            <li>Expand the links to learn more about each section</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Historical Data</h2>
          <p class="historic">This website will always display data from the current fiscal year which runs from <strong>July 1 through June 30</strong> and is determined by the year in which it ends. You can view data from previous fiscal years by clicking on the Expenditures, Revenues, Contracts or Payments to Cities and Counties tabs and choosing the fiscal year from the drop-down box. <strong>Historical data begins at July 1, 2012 (FY 2013)</strong>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="small-12 medium-6 medium-6-offset-1 columns">
        <ul class="accordion" data-accordion>
          <li class="accordion-navigation">
            <a href="#panel1a">Expenditures</a>
            <div id="panel1a" class="content active">
              <div class="row">
                <div class="small-8 columns">
                  Expenditure data identifies the agency making the payment, the vendor receiving the payment, the purpose, the amount of the expenditure, and other pertinent details. Select a link to learn more about how public funds are being spent.
                </div>
                <div class="small-4 columns">
                  <a href="https://www.ark.org/dfa/transparency/expenditures.php?ina_sec_csrf=5abc4dfde268b093fc21981a6cd8856c&do:expenditures&tab=byagency&__ncforminfo=RsqRkBzSyzTJ9-FPtCPpc_2vROezNTRobuLqQ0el51IrUX3yU_oZlnMMLn20etD6CXBL8vdppzwZN4XPm0nCuisboSFI_K9NOCPoIVclXIjfk8Rw-ROvwSHUTf2abH1y" class="button radius tiny expand yellow">By Agency</a>
                  <a href="https://www.ark.org/dfa/transparency/expenditures.php?ina_sec_csrf=5abc4dfde268b093fc21981a6cd8856c&do:expenditures&tab=byvendor&__ncforminfo=RsqRkBzSyzTJ9-FPtCPpc_2vROezNTRobuLqQ0el51IrUX3yU_oZluGsiqaIWuaEhRq3og0C4EGl3SRVZX2vGm3OHW5Il2z65DJdaQH6tbg7uSt4zpXB-nph0mhuoQFY" class="button radius tiny expand yellow">By Vendor</a>
                  <a href="https://www.ark.org/dfa/transparency/expenditures.php?ina_sec_csrf=5abc4dfde268b093fc21981a6cd8856c&do:expenditures&tab=byclassification&__ncforminfo=RsqRkBzSyzTJ9-FPtCPpc_2vROezNTRobuLqQ0el51IrUX3yU_oZlt5GOr2QJv-pm2ckibEafjRHhY-iGW1PHeTxy1yPIFo8FVhdGC-jaA48jPrFyPDbpr_-6yy3lzO-" class="button radius tiny expand yellow">By Classification</a>
                  <a href="https://www.ark.org/dfa/transparency/expenditures.php?ina_sec_csrf=5abc4dfde268b093fc21981a6cd8856c&do:expenditures&tab=byfunction&__ncforminfo=RsqRkBzSyzTJ9-FPtCPpc_2vROezNTRobuLqQ0el51IrUX3yU_oZluIjTmEXMax8sVqEEYcJ1w3HrXUe3iv_hQURcY5rXyTvZMYGgFGUSmbL62iwVbwaUlNT618_VU08" class="button radius tiny expand yellow">By Function</a>
                  <a href="https://www.ark.org/dfa/transparency/expenditures.php?ina_sec_csrf=5abc4dfde268b093fc21981a6cd8856c&do:expenditures&tab=agencydetails&__ncforminfo=RsqRkBzSyzTJ9-FPtCPpc_2vROezNTRobuLqQ0el51IrUX3yU_oZlv9F2muAX0p-ab1eNd1d9fI2sSA8AAv9HdfVzQhhd7rhJ3zlij-_VaRbAfoaPsdDoyKlKEwdt98G" class="button radius tiny expand yellow">Agency Details</a>
                  <a href="https://www.ark.org/dfa/transparency/expenditures.php?ina_sec_csrf=5abc4dfde268b093fc21981a6cd8856c&do:expenditures&tab=othertransactions&__ncforminfo=RsqRkBzSyzTJ9-FPtCPpc_2vROezNTRobuLqQ0el51IrUX3yU_oZlo9ECOvwtoDLbEOoNC1okUrvb3of2I6rJnEsjnDmE_Z53L3g8tf4krNmT4CbA3TdxJUeXoT4Jm9_" class="button radius tiny expand yellow">Transaction Type</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="accordion-navigation">
            <a href="#panel2a">Revenues</a>
            <div id="panel2a" class="content">
              <div class="row">
                <div class="small-8 columns">
                  Revenues are funds that the State is legally allowed to collect in order to finance the State's obligations. Examples of Revenues are taxes, fees, fines, or grants. Select a link to learn more about state revenues.
                </div>
                <div class="small-4 columns">
                  <a href="https://www.ark.org/dfa/transparency/revenues.php?ina_sec_csrf=5abc4dfde268b093fc21981a6cd8856c&do:revenues&tab=bysource&__ncforminfo=RsqRkBzSyzTJ9-FPtCPpc_2vROezNTRobuLqQ0el51IrUX3yU_oZlm06AuIpHCc9ekYMsyGs-tayz7JhouBkj4X8895lpEd65rdYk9wR6YMp-wYbhu4XkaGoJP0zL7Ab" class="button radius tiny expand yellow">By Source</a>
                  <a href="https://www.ark.org/dfa/transparency/revenues.php?ina_sec_csrf=5abc4dfde268b093fc21981a6cd8856c&do:revenues&tab=bytype&__ncforminfo=RsqRkBzSyzTJ9-FPtCPpc_2vROezNTRobuLqQ0el51IrUX3yU_oZljfR4dXDAblC3JV7se3EWGXo_iwqACvJhtrmXaIsf2_5vDuLuBhD3ZmpCMz5StCt5LHQpoCo0PvR" class="button radius tiny expand yellow">By Type</a>
                  <a href="https://www.ark.org/dfa/transparency/revenues.php?ina_sec_csrf=5abc4dfde268b093fc21981a6cd8856c&do:revenues&tab=byfunction&__ncforminfo=RsqRkBzSyzTJ9-FPtCPpc_2vROezNTRobuLqQ0el51IrUX3yU_oZljof2Da7maZwf2r1BWvjUcqBWKNsiaVPrTQpg4nuW3facZs3b746ZaMVcEe0gd9AqHOiUUcVXnPA" class="button radius tiny expand yellow">By Function</a>
                  <a href="https://www.ark.org/dfa/transparency/revenues.php?ina_sec_csrf=5abc4dfde268b093fc21981a6cd8856c&do:revenues&tab=byagency&__ncforminfo=RsqRkBzSyzTJ9-FPtCPpc_2vROezNTRobuLqQ0el51IrUX3yU_oZltbRa_QFHcbA2Ku2MpeDGNxt0VSD_-8RxKaHGptnd9z1oujG-GU0f3d5YO2Xm0awdpKM0oR-VfGN" class="button radius tiny expand yellow">By Agency</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="accordion-navigation">
            <a href="#panel3a">Employee Salaries</a>
            <div id="panel3a" class="content">
              <div class="row">
                <div class="small-8 columns">
                  Employee salaries are comprised of payments for salaries and wages to state employees. Select a link to learn more about Employee Salaries.
                </div>
                <div class="small-4 columns">
                  <a href="https://www.ark.org/dfa/transparency/employee_compensation.php?ina_sec_csrf=5abc4dfde268b093fc21981a6cd8856c&do:employee_compensation&tab=byagency&__ncforminfo=RsqRkBzSyzTJ9-FPtCPpc_2vROezNTRobuLqQ0el51IrUX3yU_oZliIjOvHSBbPc1Fnw7sduJDEQNKIf6MEjAGRmn6Z2bCUQ5fvuqeRpGWDuWOGhQdO2gfeTo9ckmSQ-" class="button radius tiny expand yellow">By Agency</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="accordion-navigation">
            <a href="#panel4a">Bonded Indebtedness</a>
            <div id="panel4a" class="content">
              <div class="row">
                <div class="small-8 columns">
                  Bonded Indebtedness only provides information on the bonded debt of the State of Arkansas. The Arkansas Constitution places limits on the State issuance of bonds. The entities reported in this section of the website have specific authorization by law to issue debt. Bonded Indebtedness data is updated quarterly.
                </div>
                <div class="small-4 columns">
                  <a href="https://www.ark.org/dfa/transparency/debts.php?ina_sec_csrf=5abc4dfde268b093fc21981a6cd8856c&doebts&tab=bytype&__ncforminfo=RsqRkBzSyzTJ9-FPtCPpc_2vROezNTRobuLqQ0el51IrUX3yU_oZlkGVQwvxF6j5znCV3caeJ0gf3ZSwIK07VLlCEz4aSpnqrig0ScMiyNngM8jJD3lGISepwvmzZlNj" class="button radius tiny expand yellow">By Type</a>
                  <a href="https://www.ark.org/dfa/transparency/debts.php?ina_sec_csrf=5abc4dfde268b093fc21981a6cd8856c&doebts&tab=byagency&__ncforminfo=RsqRkBzSyzTJ9-FPtCPpc_2vROezNTRobuLqQ0el51IrUX3yU_oZlj3H6iCIeMXHu4gPYCCv5_Qt3ccGWH0Bn0TULIbrODoexNBIkW80QRiGPl8O1aOR85lkmuEG9ydo" class="button radius tiny expand yellow">By Agency</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="accordion-navigation">
            <a href="#panel5a">Contracts</a>
            <div id="panel5a" class="content">
              <div class="row">
                <div class="small-8 columns">
                  State Agencies negotiate contracts with vendors to provide services or goods at set prices. Contract information is available. Choose a link to learn more about contracts awarded in Arkansas.
                </div>
                <div class="small-4 columns">
                  <a href="https://www.ark.org/dfa/transparency/contracts.php?ina_sec_csrf=5abc4dfde268b093fc21981a6cd8856c&do:contracts&tab=byvendor&__ncforminfo=RsqRkBzSyzTJ9-FPtCPpc_2vROezNTRobuLqQ0el51IrUX3yU_oZln6BXjpGlXGkv8FMFXxttZ5U6SOthi-XAcYZpZtXUHW-ACqQVsZu_qg4hiiU5RP5PliooTLWUbwS" class="button radius tiny expand yellow">By Vendor</a>
                  <a href="https://www.ark.org/dfa/transparency/contracts.php?ina_sec_csrf=5abc4dfde268b093fc21981a6cd8856c&do:contracts&tab=byagency&__ncforminfo=RsqRkBzSyzTJ9-FPtCPpc_2vROezNTRobuLqQ0el51IrUX3yU_oZlta70CE5dLaGkhpk81bSW1gvltKjahtdWMOnVxVBtTbkIKpVjqYw7hG-Q-T_6QVpaU91XrrDDcva" class="button radius tiny expand yellow">By Agency</a>
                  <a href="https://www.ark.org/dfa/transparency/contracts.php?ina_sec_csrf=5abc4dfde268b093fc21981a6cd8856c&do:contracts&tab=bycategory&__ncforminfo=RsqRkBzSyzTJ9-FPtCPpc_2vROezNTRobuLqQ0el51IrUX3yU_oZliAFsYIhKnLQGDbOv3l4KLOIMCdTbMyjOAGgOb_oT_G-w3q6O85KfFuJ7E5oYrpUku5raz4G9kbe" class="button radius tiny expand yellow">By Category</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="accordion-navigation">
            <a href="#panel6a">Payments to Cities &amp; Counties</a>
            <div id="panel6a" class="content">
              <div class="row">
                <div class="small-8 columns">
                  Cities and counties receive funding from the State to help provide services for local residents. Select a link to find more information on payments made to cities and counties.
                </div>
                <div class="small-4 columns">
                  <a href="https://www.ark.org/dfa/transparency/payments.php?ina_sec_csrf=5abc4dfde268b093fc21981a6cd8856c&doayments&tab=byagency&__ncforminfo=RsqRkBzSyzTJ9-FPtCPpc_2vROezNTRobuLqQ0el51IrUX3yU_oZlgbfOowWpMsrSvTxIYcaxCrPRqffZNZzNE5fzPUIgA6aKsBDngydLjPSSmZcJXc4kDS3Q_gKHs06" class="button radius tiny expand yellow">By Agency</a>
                  <a href="https://www.ark.org/dfa/transparency/payments.php?ina_sec_csrf=5abc4dfde268b093fc21981a6cd8856c&doayments&tab=byvendor&__ncforminfo=RsqRkBzSyzTJ9-FPtCPpc_2vROezNTRobuLqQ0el51IrUX3yU_oZlv3brkWI7aZj5OSPd-gG_VVaTye4vqidkpxX5M5g1qngBjr1591FQjLVWswEeHY2Cwm8zRuEirRh" class="button radius tiny expand yellow">By Vendor</a>
                  <a href="https://www.ark.org/dfa/transparency/payments.php?ina_sec_csrf=5abc4dfde268b093fc21981a6cd8856c&doayments&tab=byclassification&__ncforminfo=RsqRkBzSyzTJ9-FPtCPpc_2vROezNTRobuLqQ0el51IrUX3yU_oZlki6GULf1R2y5Z5JgNfn0SzrhOZRLyXhSuOrp6MjORnihiaHYnnLWAWhChq183vu6Q6u1KblRnL1" class="button radius tiny expand yellow">By Classification</a>
                  <a href="https://www.ark.org/dfa/transparency/payments.php?ina_sec_csrf=5abc4dfde268b093fc21981a6cd8856c&doayments&tab=byfunction&__ncforminfo=RsqRkBzSyzTJ9-FPtCPpc_2vROezNTRobuLqQ0el51IrUX3yU_oZli_4qlydCgAYFCl0Ez9rArirRQq01GMWGx1zbFGIHzQStxvoi7ho-vdlD1pNe2K3MRqR-W-_CR-b" class="button radius tiny expand yellow">By Functions</a>
                  <a href="https://www.ark.org/dfa/transparency/payments.php?ina_sec_csrf=5abc4dfde268b093fc21981a6cd8856c&doayments&tab=agencydetails&__ncforminfo=RsqRkBzSyzTJ9-FPtCPpc_2vROezNTRobuLqQ0el51IrUX3yU_oZlpny-3COalREQNDW_v5H-8NI9zZss5aZ99Obg4GQCynLdcbuLSwVJnjP8KxDOYVAYfIYKZQekJ3P" class="button radius tiny expand yellow">By Agency Details</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
